S = {'cc': 'SV', 'fam': 'Consumption', 'doc': '# El Salvador 2025: Impuesto a la Transferencia de Bienes Muebles y a la Prestación de Servicios (5111); FOVIAL, tobacco, alcohol and soft-drink taxes (5121)\n\nSource: Ley de Impuesto a la Transferencia de Bienes Muebles y a la Prestación de Servicios, D.L. 296 of 24 July 1992\n(D.O. 143, T. 316, 31 July 1992), Asamblea Legislativa consolidated text (Índice Legislativo, `leyes-y-decretos/view/3544`,\nfetched 2026-11-21; `sv/law/ley_iva_dl296_asamblea.pdf`, ARCHIVE_INDEX.tsv). Its reform list runs to D.L. 586 of 20 May\n2026; the 2025-2026 entries are special-purpose decrees (projects, CEL contracts, renewable energy, statistics) that do not\ntouch arts. 46 or 54. Grade A.\n* **Art. 54**: "LA TASA DEL IMPUESTO ES EL TRECE POR CIENTO" (reform (2), D.L. 370 of 1995); no reduced rate.\n* **Art. 46 (exempt services)**: a) health services by public institutions and those of public utility; b) rent of\n  dwellings; e) education by institutions authorised by the Ministry of Education; f) interest on deposits and loans; h)\n  water and sewerage by public institutions; i) "De transporte público terrestre de pasajeros"; j) "SEGUROS DE PERSONAS,\n  EN LO QUE SE REFIERE AL PAGO DE LAS PRIMAS".\n* No exemption for food, medicines, electricity, fuel or books in the Act: all taxed at 13 %.\n\n**Excises (pass 12, grade B - the compilations are of August 2022 and later reforms were not checked (FT reviewer 6); Ministerio de Hacienda "Índice Legislativo" compilations, Wayback captures of 23 Aug 2022,\n`sv/law/mh_dc58*.pdf`; reforms after August 2022 not checked):**\n* **FOVIAL: Ley del Fondo de Conservación Vial (D.L. 208/2000) art. 26**: "EL VALOR DE LA CONTRIBUCIÓN DE CONSERVACIÓN\n  VIAL SERÁ DE VEINTE CENTAVOS DE DÓLAR AMERICANO (US $0.20) POR GALÓN DE DIESEL, GASOLINAS O SUS MEZCLAS": 0.20 /\n  3.785 per litre. **COTRANS** (US$ 0.10 per gallon, Ley transitoria de estabilización de tarifas del transporte) is not\n  held: not charged (lower bound). **Ley de Impuesto Especial sobre Combustibles (D.L. 225/2009) art. 3**: ad valorem\n  1 % / 0.5 % / 0 % by the international reference price of the barrel (above US$ 70: 0 %); the quarterly reference\n  price is not an input: not charged, flagged.\n* **Tobacco: Ley de Impuestos sobre Productos del Tabaco (D.L. 539/2004, reform D.L. 235/2009) art. 4**: A) "$0.0225\n  por cada cigarro, cigarrillo, cigarrito"; B) "treinta y nueve por ciento (39%) sobre el precio sugerido de venta al\n  consumidor declarado, excluyendo el [IVA] y el Impuesto Específico" - the ad valorem stays inside its own base, so it\n  is 39 % of (price / 1.13 - specific) (custom line `tobDuty`). Puros/habanos 100 % and picado per gram: other tobacco\n  not charged (flagged).\n* **Alcohol: Ley Reguladora de la Producción y Comercialización del Alcohol y de las Bebidas Alcohólicas (D.L.\n  640/1996, reforms D.L. 239/2009 and 462/2010) art. 43**: ad valorem 8 % on the suggested price "excluyendo los\n  impuestos establecidos en la presente Ley y el [IVA]" (the kernel line\'s value before excise and VAT), plus the tax\n  on alcohol content per 1 % vol per litre: cerveza 0.0900, vinos 0.0900, ron > 37 % and vodka > 37 % 0.0900, whisky,\n  gin, licores 0.1600: US$ 9.00 per litre of pure alcohol for beer, wine and spirits (whisky, gin and liqueurs at\n  US$ 16.00 flagged). A line without `abvBp` pays only the ad valorem part.\n* **Soft drinks: Ley de Impuesto sobre las Bebidas Gaseosas, Isotónicas, Fortificantes o Energizantes, Jugos, Néctares,\n  Refrescos y Preparaciones Concentradas (D.L. 237/2009) art. 4 B) 1**: 10 % on the suggested price excluding this tax\n  and IVA (non-alcoholic drinks read as carbonated; juices and isotonic drinks 5 %, energy drinks + US$ 0.20 per litre,\n  flagged).', 'vat': {'name': 'Impuesto a la Transferencia de Bienes Muebles y a la Prestación de Servicios (IVA)', 'standard': 1300, 'statute': 'D.L. 296/1992 art. 54 (13 %), art. 46 a), b), e), f), h), i), j) (exempt services); Asamblea consolidated text to D.L. 586/2026', 'classes': {'health': 'exempt', 'rent': 'exempt', 'education': 'exempt', 'financial': 'exempt', 'water': 'exempt', 'transport': 'exempt', 'insurance': 'exempt'}}, 'unsupported': [['g.consumption.any fun s => s.good == .health', 'health services read as public or public-utility providers (exempt, art. 46 a)); private health services are taxed at 13 % (lower bound)'], ['g.consumption.any fun s => s.good == .petrol || s.good == .diesel', 'fuel: FOVIAL only; COTRANS (US$ 0.10/gal, law not held) and the D.L. 225/2009 ad valorem (0-1 % by the barrel reference price) not charged (lower bound)'], ['g.consumption.any fun s => s.good == .tobaccoOther', 'other tobacco (puros 100 %, picado per gram) not charged'], ['g.consumption.any fun s => s.good == .spirits', 'spirits at US$ 0.09 per % vol per litre (rum, vodka > 37 %); whisky, gin, liqueurs US$ 0.16 (upper rate not applied)'], ['g.consumption.any fun s => s.good == .beer || s.good == .wine || s.good == .spirits || s.good == .cigarettes || s.good == .nonAlcoholic', 'the suggested consumer price taken equal to the price paid; non-alcoholic drinks read as carbonated (10 %)']], 'ex': [{'good': 'petrol', 'name': 'Contribución de Conservación Vial (FOVIAL)', 'num': 20000, 'den': 378500, 'statute': 'Ley del Fondo de Conservación Vial art. 26: US$ 0.20 per gallon'}, {'good': 'diesel', 'name': 'Contribución de Conservación Vial (FOVIAL)', 'num': 20000, 'den': 378500, 'statute': 'Ley del Fondo de Conservación Vial art. 26: US$ 0.20 per gallon'}, {'good': 'beer', 'name': 'Impuestos sobre bebidas alcohólicas (cerveza)', 'num': 9, 'pure': True, 'adv': 800, 'vat': 1300, 'statute': 'D.L. 640/1996 art. 43: 8 % ad valorem + US$ 0.09 per 1 % vol per litre (22.03)'}, {'good': 'wine', 'name': 'Impuestos sobre bebidas alcohólicas (vino)', 'num': 9, 'pure': True, 'adv': 800, 'vat': 1300, 'statute': 'D.L. 640/1996 art. 43: 8 % ad valorem + US$ 0.09 per 1 % vol per litre (22.04)'}, {'good': 'spirits', 'name': 'Impuestos sobre bebidas alcohólicas (destiladas)', 'num': 9, 'pure': True, 'adv': 800, 'vat': 1300, 'statute': 'D.L. 640/1996 art. 43: 8 % ad valorem + US$ 0.09 per 1 % vol per litre (22.08.40.10 ron, 22.08.60 vodka > 37 %)'}, {'good': 'nonAlcoholic', 'name': 'Impuesto sobre bebidas gaseosas', 'adv': 1000, 'vat': 1300, 'statute': 'D.L. 237/2009 art. 4 B) 1 (10 %)'}], 'lean': '/-- Ley de Impuestos sobre Productos del Tabaco art. 4 A): US$ 0.0225 per cigarette (`quantity` in thousandths of a stick). -/\ndef tobSpecific (s : Spend) : Int := divR .down (s.quantity * 225) (10000 * 1000)\n/-- art. 4 B): 39 % of the suggested price net of IVA (13 %) and of the specific tax; the ad valorem stays in its base. -/\ndef tobDuty (s : Spend) : Int :=\n  tobSpecific s + divR .down (3900 * pos (divR .down (pos s.amount * BP) 11300 - tobSpecific s)) BP\ndef tobaccoF : Family :=\n  { name := "5121 tabaco", covers := [.excise], run := fun _ g _ => g.consumption.filterMap fun s =>\n      if s.good == .cigarettes then\n        some (charge .excise "Impuestos sobre productos del tabaco" s.amount id (fun _ => tobDuty s) (event := s.good.name)\n          (bearer := .consumer) (statute := "Ley de Impuestos sobre Productos del Tabaco (D.L. 539/2004) art. 4 A), B)"))\n      else none }', 'families': '[vatF, exciseF, tobaccoF]', 'guards': ['vat.embedded { good := .clothing, amount := 1130 } == 130', 'vat.embedded { good := .food, amount := 1130 } == 130', 'vat.embedded { good := .rent, amount := 1130 } == 0', 'vat.embedded { good := .transport, amount := 1130 } == 0', '-- 100 litres of petrol: FOVIAL 100 x 0.20 / 3.785 = 5.28', '(lines.find? (·.good == .petrol)).get!.duty { good := .petrol, amount := 120, quantity := 100000 } == 5', '-- 100 litres of beer at 5 % vol for US$ 300: 5 l pure x 9 = 45; 300 / 1.13 = 265, less 45 = 220, / 1.08 = 203, 8 % = 16', '(lines.find? (·.good == .beer)).get!.duty { good := .beer, amount := 300, quantity := 100000, abvBp := 500 } == 61', '-- 1,000 cigarettes for US$ 226: specific 22.5 -> 22; 226 / 1.13 = 200, less 22 = 178, 39 % = 69.4', 'tobDuty { good := .cigarettes, amount := 226, quantity := 1000000 } == 91', '-- soft drinks US$ 113: 100 net of IVA, / 1.10 = 90, 10 % = 9', '(lines.find? (·.good == .nonAlcoholic)).get!.duty { good := .nonAlcoholic, amount := 113 } == 9'], 'taxes': [{'oecd': '5111', 'tax': 'Impuesto a la Transferencia de Bienes Muebles y a la Prestación de Servicios (IVA)', 'statute': 'D.L. 296/1992 arts. 46, 54', 'dated': 'Asamblea consolidated text with reforms to 20 May 2026 (none to arts. 46, 54 after 2024)', 'grade': 'A', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': ['Vat'], 'unsupported': ['private health services']}, {'oecd': '5121', 'tax': 'Contribución de Conservación Vial (FOVIAL)', 'statute': 'Ley del Fondo de Conservación Vial art. 26', 'dated': 'MH compilation, Wayback 2022-08-23; reforms after August 2022 not checked (FT reviewer 6: B)', 'grade': 'B', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': ['ExLine'], 'unsupported': ['COTRANS (US$ 0.10/gal) law not held', 'D.L. 225/2009 ad valorem by barrel price not charged']}, {'oecd': '5121', 'tax': 'Impuestos sobre productos del tabaco', 'statute': 'D.L. 539/2004 art. 4 (reform D.L. 235/2009)', 'dated': 'MH compilation, Wayback 2022-08-23; reforms after August 2022 not checked (FT reviewer 6: B)', 'grade': 'B', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': ['custom tobDuty'], 'unsupported': ['other tobacco not charged']}, {'oecd': '5121', 'tax': 'Impuestos sobre bebidas alcohólicas (ad valorem y contenido alcohólico)', 'statute': 'D.L. 640/1996 art. 43 (reforms D.L. 239/2009, 462/2010)', 'dated': "MH compilation 'ref 2010', Wayback 2022-08-23; reforms after August 2022 not checked (FT reviewer 6: B)", 'grade': 'B', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': ['ExLine'], 'unsupported': ['whisky/gin/liqueur rate', 'strength needed for the specific part']}, {'oecd': '5121', 'tax': 'Impuesto sobre bebidas gaseosas, isotónicas, energizantes, jugos y refrescos', 'statute': 'D.L. 237/2009 art. 4', 'dated': 'MH compilation, Wayback 2022-08-23; reforms after August 2022 not checked (FT reviewer 6: B)', 'grade': 'B', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': ['ExLine'], 'unsupported': ['all non-alcoholic drinks read as carbonated']}, {'oecd': '5112', 'tax': 'General sales / turnover tax (other than VAT)', 'statute': 'Constitución art. 231', 'dated': 'lexifina repository text; pass 12, 2026-11-21', 'grade': 'A', 'status': 'not levied', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': ['Absent'], 'why': 'Not levied (convention R5-3k-G, pass 12): Constitución art. 231: "No pueden imponerse contribuciones sino en virtud de una ley y para el servicio público" (`sv/law/const_art-231.md`). no law read in this build levies a general sales or turnover tax beside the VAT of the 5111 row (laws read include: D.L. 296/1992 arts. 46, 54; Ley del Fondo de Conservación Vial art. 26; D.L. 539/2004 art. 4 (reform D.L. 235/2009); D.L. 640/1996 art. 43 (reforms D.L. 239/2009, 462/2010); D.L. 237/2009 art. 4; Ley de Impuesto sobre la Renta (D.L. 134/1991) art. 41 (D.L. 957/2011): 30 %).'}], 'absent': [['salesTax', 'Not levied (convention R5-3k-G, pass 12): Constitución art. 231: "No pueden imponerse contribuciones sino en virtud de una ley y para el servicio público" (`sv/law/const_art-231.md`). no law read in this build levies a general sales or turnover tax beside the VAT of the 5111 row (laws read include: D.L. 296/1992 arts. 46, 54; Ley del Fondo de Conservación Vial art. 26; D.L. 539/2004 art. 4 (reform D.L. 235/2009); D.L. 640/1996 art. 43 (reforms D.L. 239/2009, 462/2010); D.L. 237/2009 art. 4; Ley de Impuesto sobre la Renta (D.L. 134/1991) art. 41 (D.L. 957/2011): 30 %).']]}
